<%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy' }) %>

<main class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 px-4 py-10 text-slate-100">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute -left-40 -top-40 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-brand-600/20 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -right-40 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-violet-600/20 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <a href="/dashboard" class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-400 transition hover:text-brand-300"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Back to dashboard</a>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl sm:p-12">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-violet-600 shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/40"><i class="bi bi-shield-check text-2xl text-white"></i></div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect your name, phone number, vehicle details and booking history to provide vehicle repair and maintenance services. Photos you upload (vehicle or profile images) are stored securely via our media provider.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
          <p>Your information is used to schedule appointments, notify you about service status, and improve our service offerings. We never sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">3. Data Security</h2>
          <p>Passwords are hashed before storage and all sessions are secured with encrypted tokens. We apply industry-standard safeguards to protect your data.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">4. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You may request correction or deletion of your account and associated records at any time by contacting support.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-base font-bold text-white">5. Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy can be directed to our support team via the contact channel provided in the application settings.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
